{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52530","headline":"教民祭蜡 · 陈元光","name":"教民祭蜡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉垒陈酽酪，金盌荐芳饎。\n父老吹龙笛，官僚仗虎墀。\n山川出云雨，神只回耀辉。\n舞蹈幽明洽，趋跄礼度微。\n祈禳称世世，民社两无违。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}